          "git_sha": "559b454124ea60101e7e0175697c87deca745fdf",
          "line_end": 57,
          "line_start": 52,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "agent-of-empires/agent-of-empires",
          "url": "https://github.com/agent-of-empires/agent-of-empires/blob/bdf21c256673c10cdf8e548a6a652b1bedf621cb/README.md#L52-L57"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_de8e2e862d4ad7e11e7243dc6f58851da9e1e1f4a12b1e1cf372cce334bc0aca"
      ],
      "text": "The product exposes TUI, web, CLI, and HTTP API surfaces, with status detection, notifications, persistent tmux sessions, git worktrees, multi-repo workspaces, and Docker/Podman/Apple Containers sandboxing."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_7113bde0f45b0da92bbb4996fd1f6dbab00a8bb93db8c3aed13e2e5f26bd835f",
