          "line_end": 6,
          "line_start": 3,
          "path": "docs/api.md",
          "repository": "agent-of-empires/agent-of-empires",
          "url": "https://github.com/agent-of-empires/agent-of-empires/blob/bdf21c256673c10cdf8e548a6a652b1bedf621cb/docs/api.md#L3-L6"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_5eb457bcbf5b51426e0b3df9d008e9e59a6d1c7d53bf61b9db7ccdd95d9015e5"
      ],
      "text": "`aoe serve` exposes an HTTP API so external orchestrators such as other agents, MCP tools, or CI scripts can drive sessions without attaching to a terminal; the web dashboard uses the same API plus internal routes."
    },
