  "summary": "Agent of Empires (AoE) is a Rust-based session manager for AI coding agents on Linux/macOS, wrapping tmux sessions with a TUI, web dashboard, CLI, and HTTP API. Evidence covers its runtime features, HTTP API surface, skills management, configuration layering, and development commands. Evidence coverage: 134 of 344 packet slices were shown to the model; the rest were withheld by the prompt budget.",
